solution:
**Given:**

7.4 : 3.7 :: 3.7 : x

**Formula used:**

If a : b :: c : d, then dfrac{a}{b} = dfrac{c}{d}.

**Calculation:**

dfrac{7.4}{3.7} = dfrac{3.7}{x}

⇒ dfrac{7.4}{3.7} = dfrac{3.7}{x}

⇒ x = dfrac{3.7 times 3.7}{7.4}

⇒ x = dfrac{13.69}{7.4}

⇒ x = 1.85

**∴ The correct answer is option (3).**
